  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>God may not play dice with the universe, but you do.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one or more of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to any of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.D8wlyytUDg2oEbkx]{Density Control}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.5r7HjDoWoSVm9d5e]{Intangibility}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.pjArTyAxecwPdHvf]{Invisibility}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.kTRnwcMJLHbZopWQ]{Speed}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fbddUiHTU2MMOSU6]{Teleportation}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.MCfvbWF3GUPDWbLz]{Transmutation}</p><p>• Select from Intellectual powers category</p><p>• Select from Psychic powers category</p><p>• Select from Technological powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Information qualities category</p><p>• Select from Mental qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of the following Green abilities, using two different powers.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.KJvFASlenNY0sSBA]{Negative Likelihood}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.TC41oPt3tSKb2SG5]{Not Quite Right}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.Y0Xbq8dcJCEQF0OG]{Probability Insight}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.13IFS1DIP1WF0xtR]{Warp Space}</li></ul><p>Gain one of the following Yellow abilities.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.RpDSe6yBo7Kqf8or]{Alternate Outcome}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.QCPlGUrHV6fgx0KV]{Helpful Analysis}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.mSh4GyDSY9nUUgz9]{Never Happened}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.jxPFhNVJEU9lDC1s]{Retroactive Rewrite}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Expertise principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
